    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_InformationAboutRotom",
      "en_US": [
        "There is a mysterious notebook here.\n",
        "Its age is impossible to tell.\r",
        "“It was by pure chance that I obtained\n",
        "information about the Pokémon ROTOM.\r",
        "“Remarkably, ROTOM has the ability to\n",
        "enter and merge with special motors.\r",
        "“It’s now known that ROTOM can stay\n",
        "inside a motor almost indefinitely.\r",
        "“However, it will emerge if it enters a\n",
        "Union Room or a Wi-Fi Club.\r",
        "“ROTOM will also emerge from the motor\n",
        "if it is left at the Day Care.\r",
        "“ROTOM may also forget certain moves\n",
        "when it leaves a motor.\r",
        "“This Pokémon requires exhaustive\n",
        "observation and analysis.\r",
        "“To ensure I get all the credit, my\n",
        "ROTOM research must be kept secret.\r",
        "“They will come to recognize me as the\n",
        "scientific genius Char...”\r",
        "The rest of the notebook is blank."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un mystérieux carnet. Impossible de\n",
        "savoir de quand il date.\r",
        "“C’est par pur hasard que j’ai recueilli\n",
        "des données sur le Pokémon MOTISMA.\r",
        "MOTISMA a une remarquable aptitude à\n",
        "intégrer certains moteurs.\r",
        "On sait désormais qu’il peut rester\n",
        "dans un moteur quasi-indéfiniment.\r",
        "Cependant, il en sort dès son entrée \n",
        "dans une Salle Union ou un Club Wi-Fi.\r",
        "De même si on le confie à une Pension.\r",
        "Par ailleurs, MOTISMA est susceptible\n",
        "d’oublier certaines capacités à sa\f",
        "sortie d’un moteur.\r",
        "Il s’avère nécessaire de conduire une\n",
        "étude exhaustive de ce Pokémon.\r",
        "Afin d’écarter toute concurrence, mes\n",
        "travaux sur MOTISMA doivent rester\f",
        "secrets.\r",
        "Tous finiront par me reconnaître\n",
        "comme le savant génial Plu...”\r",
        "Les pages suivantes sont blanches."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_ImagineFindingYouHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Ah, imagine finding you here!\r",
        "You must be eager to fill your Pokédex\n",
        "to be searching even here.\r",
        "What am I doing?\r",
        "I visit a professor I know in Eterna\n",
        "every so often.\r",
        "He tells me intriguing rumors of rare\n",
        "Pokémon sightings and such.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Toi, ici?\r",
        "Tu dois te consacrer jour et nuit à ton\n",
        "Pokédex pour venir fureter jusqu’ici.\r",
        "Ce que je fais là?\r",
        "L’un de mes confrères habite à\n",
        "Vestigion, et je viens lui rendre\f",
        "visite de temps à autre.\r",
        "Il me raconte des rumeurs étranges\n",
        "relatives à l’apparition de Pokémon\f",
        "rares.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_PokemonThatSlipsIntoAppliances",
      "en_US": [
        "A Pokémon that slips into electric\n",
        "appliances, you say...\r",
        "Hmm...\r",
        "That is somewhat off from what I’ve\n",
        "heard about it.\r",
        "Hmm...\n",
        "This is what I’ve heard.\r",
        "Long ago, there was a Pokémon that\n",
        "merged with a toy robot.\r",
        "Should that Pokémon be recognized as a\n",
        "new species or not...\r",
        "Debates over the issue were about to\n",
        "start when they were rendered moot.\r",
        "The very topic of discussion--the\n",
        "Pokémon-infused robot--disappeared...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un Pokémon qui se glisse dans les\n",
        "appareils électriques, dis-tu...\r",
        "Hum...\r",
        "Ce n’est pas exactement ce que l’on\n",
        "m’avait dit...\r",
        "Hum...\n",
        "Voici ce que j’ai entendu dire.\r",
        "Il y a de cela bien longtemps, un\n",
        "Pokémon a fusionné avec un petit robot.\r",
        "Devrait-on, oui ou non, le considérer\n",
        "comme une nouvelle espèce?\r",
        "Les débats à ce sujet allaient débuter,\n",
        "mais ils n’eurent pas lieu.\r",
        "En effet, le Pokémon-robot, le cœur\n",
        "même de la controverse, avait disparu.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_RotomInterestingPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Anyway, this ROTOM...\n",
        "What an interesting Pokémon.\r",
        "So, you say it enters an appliance and\n",
        "essentially merges with the device.\r",
        "In the process, it may also learn new\n",
        "moves.\r",
        "In a way, I suppose it could be thought\n",
        "of as a mechanical Pokémon.\r",
        "Hmm...!\r",
        "Though it is utterly unique, it is\n",
        "undeniably a form of Pokémon.\r",
        "Fine, fine, so be it!\r",
        "No matter how old one gets, there will\n",
        "always be new Pokémon discoveries!\r",
        "Take care, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Quoi qu’il en soit, ce MOTISMA est un\n",
        "Pokémon captivant.\r",
        "Tu dis qu’il entre dans un appareil\n",
        "électrique pour fusionner avec?\r",
        "Ce faisant, il est fort possible qu’il\n",
        "apprenne de nouvelles capacités.\r",
        "D’une certaine manière, on pourrait le\n",
        "considérer comme un Pokémon mécanique.\r",
        "Hum...!\r",
        "Bien qu’unique en son genre, c’est\n",
        "indubitablement une forme de Pokémon.\r",
        "Soit, soit!\r",
        "Comme quoi, même un vieux savant comme\n",
        "moi n’est pas au bout de ses surprises\f",
        "en ce qui concerne les Pokémon!\r",
        "Bonne continuation, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_ReadOldNotebook",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s an old notebook.\n",
        "There’s no telling how old it is.\r",
        "Would you like to read it?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un vieux carnet.\n",
        "Impossible de savoir de quand il date.\r",
        "Désirez-vous le lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_PokemonEmergedFromLawnMower",
      "en_US": [
        "“Our encounter was a sudden one.\r",
        "“It was when I found my toy robot,\n",
        "one that I had earlier misplaced.\r",
        "“At that instant, a Pokémon startlingly\n",
        "emerged from the lawn mower’s motor!\r",
        "“Clutching my robot, I stared,\n",
        "transfixed by the peculiar Pokémon.”\r",
        "...Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Notre rencontre fut aussi soudaine\n",
        "qu’inattendue.\r",
        "Je venais de retrouver le petit\n",
        "robot que j’avais perdu.\r",
        "C’est là qu’un Pokémon a brusquement\n",
        "émergé du moteur de la tondeuse!\r",
        "M’agrippant à mon robot, j’étais\n",
        "pétrifié par cette étrange apparition.”\r",
        "... Continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_PokemonHoveredInTheAir",
      "en_US": [
        "“The Pokémon hovered in the air, held\n",
        "aloft by a power unseen.\r",
        "“As if curious and unafraid of my\n",
        "presence, it floated toward me.\r",
        "“Crackling sounds accompanied it, as \n",
        "if from static electricity in the air.\r",
        "“Remarkably, it seemed the Pokémon\n",
        "was the source of this power!\r",
        "“In alarm, I flinched, certain that my\n",
        "face would be subjected to a shock.\r",
        "“Much to my surprise, the Pokémon\n",
        "seemed to favor me with a smile.”\r",
        "...Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Le Pokémon lévitait, comme soutenu\n",
        "par une force invisible.\r",
        "Il s’approcha, curieux et nullement\n",
        "effrayé par ma présence.\r",
        "On entendait des craquements, comme\n",
        "si l’air était chargé d’électricité\f",
        "statique.\r",
        "Quelle ne fut pas ma surprise quand\n",
        "je réalisai que cette énergie émanait\f",
        "du Pokémon lui-même!\r",
        "Alarmé, je tressaillis, certain que\n",
        "j’allais prendre une décharge.\r",
        "Je restai médusé quand le Pokémon me\n",
        "gratifia d’un sourire.”\r",
        "... Continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_INameThisRotom",
      "en_US": [
        "“Finally, I came to realize that the\n",
        "Pokémon only wished to be friends.\r",
        "“I have decided to name this most\n",
        "wondrous Pokémon ’ROTOM.’\r",
        "“Simple though it may be, ROTOM emerged\n",
        "to me from the motor of a lawn mower.\r",
        "“Motor and ROTOM...\n",
        "Surely the link is obvious?”\r",
        "...Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“Je finis par comprendre que tout ce\n",
        "qu’il désirait, c’était devenir mon ami.\r",
        "Je décidai d’appeler cet incroyable\n",
        "Pokémon MOTISMA.\r",
        "Aussi simple que cela puisse paraître,\n",
        "MOTISMA m’était apparu au sortir du\f",
        "moteur d’une tondeuse.\r",
        "Moteur, MOTISMA...\n",
        "Le lien me semblait évident.”\r",
        "... Continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_AbilityToEnterMachinery",
      "en_US": [
        "“ROTOM is a Pokémon that is simply\n",
        "sensational.\r",
        "“The fact that it can turn invisible is\n",
        "simply the beginning.\r",
        "“What makes ROTOM unique is its ability\n",
        "to enter and operate machinery!”\r",
        "...This is about halfway through.\n",
        "Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“MOTISMA est un Pokémon tout\n",
        "bonnement sensationnel.\r",
        "Son aptitude à devenir invisible n’est\n",
        "que la face émergée de l’iceberg.\r",
        "Ce qui le rend unique, c’est sa\n",
        "capacité à fusionner avec toutes\f",
        "sortes d’appareils!”\r",
        "... Vous en êtes à la moitié.\n",
        "Continuer à lire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "RotomsRoom_Text_RotomAndIBecameFriends",
      "en_US": [
        "“ROTOM and I became fast friends.\n",
        "We were perpetual companions.\r",
        "“The electricity from its body forbade\n",
        "contact, however.\r",
        "“We could not touch, let alone hug or\n",
        "hold hands, but we cared not.\r",
        "“For we were bonded on a much deeper,\n",
        "incorporeal level.”\r",
        "...Would you like to keep reading?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "“MOTISMA et moi sommes vite devenus\n",
        "amis. Nous étions inséparables.\r",
        "Cependant, l’électricité générée par\n",
        "son corps interdisait tout contact.\r",
        "Impossible de nous toucher, sans même\n",
